{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cdy77CV4pSACeMwEFQi6B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Provenance\n\nOn 2026-07-19, the `deploy-staging` job restored a stale cache entry because the cache key was based only on branch name and did not include the lockfile hash (Source 2, 14:07). The stale artifact caused staging to serve a build from the previous week, discovered during the deploy process (Source 2, 14:02). Investigation identified the root cause at the cache step, and adding the lockfile hash to the cache key resolved the issue (Source 2, 14:31). Approximately 40 minutes elapsed from discovery to fix (Source 2, 14:44), marking the first observed instance of this failure mode in the deployment pipeline (Source 2, 14:44)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":497,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
